# Nimki V Language Syntax
name: V
extensions: .v .vsh
comment_single: //
comment_multi_start: /*
comment_multi_end: */
keywords: fn mut pub if else for in return break continue match struct enum interface type import module defer unsafe go or assert
types: int i8 i16 i64 i128 u8 u16 u32 u64 u128 f32 f64 bool string rune byte voidptr none true false
